==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For people doing this stage for the first time, Enma dies to [[Whale Cat]] and [[Dragon Cat]]. For sweaty Legend Net grinders, you can rush this stage even before Enma appears. A bunch of Starting Money Combos, [[Fishman Cat]], and [[Bullet Train Cat]] should do the trick.

